  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "Polygon zkEVM Bridge is the canonical bridge for transferring assets between Ethereum and Polygon zkEVM. On Ethereum, the bridge is exposed through a TransparentUpgradeableProxy that delegates to native Polygon/AggLayer bridge implementation logic for custody, deposits, and withdrawals; the logical bridge implementation should not be treated as OpenZeppelin standard-library code.",
